 style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (metrics.latencyP99 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy.latencyP99Threshold) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`P99 latency ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metrics</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">latencyP99</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms exceeds threshold`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rollbackAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>蓝绿部署维护双环境，通过负载均衡切换实现秒级发布和回滚</li>\n<li>资源开销是最大代价——需要 2x 的基础设施成本</li>\n<li>数据库迁移必须采用 Expand-Contract 模式，确保新旧版本代码兼容</li>\n<li>Kubernetes 中通过 Service selector 切换实现，配合 readinessProbe 确保就绪</li>\n<li>健康检查 + 自动回滚是安全网——错误率或延迟超阈值时自动切回旧版本</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"蓝绿部署","id":"蓝绿部署"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实现架构","id":"实现架构"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库迁移兼容","id":"数据库迁移兼容"},{"level":2,"text":"健康检查与自动回滚","id":"健康检查与自动回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Flaky 测试治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/testing-in-ci/flaky-tests"},"next":{"title":"金丝雀部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/deployment-strategies/canary-deployment"}}